msgid "Change the filters for Control List"
msgstr "Modifier les filtres de la liste de contrôle"

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:13
msgid ""
"Filters allow Pyrrha to automatically skip certain tokens during annotation "
"based on their form or lemma.\n"
"            Skipped tokens are not presented for correction and their "
"annotation is left unchanged.\n"
"            Enable the filters that are relevant to your corpus."
msgstr ""
"Les filtres permettent à Pyrrha d'ignorer automatiquement certains tokens "
"pendant l'annotation, selon leur forme ou leur lemme. Les tokens ignorés ne "
"sont pas proposés à la correction et leur annotation reste inchangée. "
"Activez les filtres pertinents pour votre corpus."

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:25
#: app/templates/control_lists/information_read.html:24
#: app/templates/main/corpus_new.html:353
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Ignorer"

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:28
msgid ""
"Skips tokens whose lemma is <code>[IGNORE]</code>. Use this to mark tokens "
"that should never be annotated, such as editorial markers or tokens "
"deliberately excluded from the analysis."
msgstr ""
"Ignore les tokens dont le lemme est <code>[IGNORE]</code>. Utilisez-le pour "
"marquer les tokens qui ne doivent jamais être annotés, comme les marques "
"éditoriales ou les tokens volontairement exclus de l'analyse."

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:36
#: app/templates/control_lists/information_read.html:22
#: app/templates/main/corpus_new.html:331
msgid "Punctuation"
msgstr "Ponctuation"

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:39
msgid ""
"Skips tokens whose form consists entirely of non-alphanumeric characters "
"(e.g. <code>.</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>;</code>). Punctuation tokens "
"typically do not require lemmatisation."
msgstr ""
"Ignore les tokens dont la forme ne comporte que des caractères non "
"alphanumériques (p. ex. <code>.</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>;</code>). Les"
" tokens de ponctuation n'ont généralement pas besoin d'être lemmatisés."

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:47
#: app/templates/control_lists/information_read.html:21
#: app/templates/main/corpus_new.html:337
msgid "Numeral"
msgstr "Nombres"

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:50
msgid ""
"Skips tokens whose form consists entirely of digits (e.g. <code>1</code>, "
"<code>42</code>). Numeral tokens are generally not relevant for lexical "
"annotation."
msgstr ""
"Ignore les tokens dont la forme ne comporte que des chiffres (p. ex. "
"<code>1</code>, <code>42</code>). Les tokens numériques ne sont généralement"
" pas pertinents pour l'annotation lexicale."

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:58
#: app/templates/control_lists/information_read.html:23
#: app/templates/main/corpus_new.html:11 app/templates/main/corpus_new.html:347
#: app/templates/main/corpus_preferences.html:9
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "Métadonnées"

#: app/templates/control_lists/ignore_filter.html:61
msgid ""
"Skips tokens whose form matches the pattern <code>[Key:Value]</code> (e.g. "
"<code>[Milestone:chapter_1]</code>). These tokens encode structural or "
"documentary metadata embedded in the token stream and should not be "
"annotated as words."
msgstr ""
"Ignore les tokens dont la forme correspond au motif "
"<code>[Clé:Valeur]</code> (p. ex. <code>[Milestone:chapter_1]</code>). Ces "
"tokens encodent des métadonnées structurelles ou documentaires insérées dans"
" le flux de tokens et ne doivent pas être annotés comme des mots."

