#: app/templates/main/index.html:5
msgid "Welcome to Pyrrha !"
msgstr "Bienvenue sur Pyrrha !"

#: app/templates/main/index.html:6
msgid ""
"Pyrrha is a simple Python Flask WebApp to fasten the post-correction of "
"lemmatized and morpho-syntactic tagged corpora."
msgstr ""
"Pyrrha est une application web Python Flask simple pour accélérer la post-"
"correction de corpus lemmatisés et étiquetés morpho-syntaxiquement."

#: app/templates/main/index.html:7
msgid ""
"It is under active development at the <a "
"href=\"http://www.chartes.psl.eu\">École Nationale des Chartes</a> and can "
"be found on <a href=\"https://github.com/hipster-"
"philology/pyrrha\">github</a>."
msgstr ""
"Elle est en développement actif à l'<a "
"href=\"http://www.chartes.psl.eu\">École nationale des chartes</a> et se "
"trouve sur <a href=\"https://github.com/hipster-"
"philology/pyrrha\">GitHub</a>."

#: app/templates/main/index.html:8
msgid ""
"To cite it in a paper, please use the information available on <a "
"href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2325427\">Zenodo</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pour la citer dans une publication, utilisez les informations disponibles "
"sur <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2325427\">Zenodo</a>"

